	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Even by the standards of other adepts, you really push yourself hard, but all of that work has begun to pay off. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Strength, Dexterity, or Wisdom score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with Acrobatics and Athletics, or an expertise die if you are already proficient. Your maximum expertise die for both of these skills becomes a d10.</p></li><li><p>Your movement speeds all increase by 10 feet.</p></li><li><p>You gain an additional @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.ec1turlvb2g9ivgd]{Practiced Technique}. It does not count against your practiced techniques known.</p></li></ul>",
